

# --- Repo commit convention (delete these comments before saving) -----------
# Summary line, <= 72 chars, "Area: what changed" in the repo's narrative
# style, e.g.:
#   Grafika Ultra: twelve opt-in render components, one toggle each
#   Deps: bump brace-expansion override to 5.0.8
#
# Body: explain WHY the change exists and which contracts it keeps or moves
# (multiplayer three-questions, pinned SOURCE shapes, storage lockdown...).
# A changed pinned shape MUST update its pin in this same commit.
#
# End with the verification you actually ran, e.g.:
#   Verified: npm run check (exit 0); tools/gfx-ultra-qa.mjs 23/23 PASS.
